From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Faris <frs@hbb.dev>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:06:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] vim: Add word and line flash jumps

Adds vim::PushFlashWord, which labels every visible word start and narrows
to words that begin with the typed text, and vim::PushFlashLine, which
labels every visible line start and takes no pattern. Both reuse the flash
jump operator.
